export function settings(auth){identity(auth);return{hasKey:!!value('key',null),model:value('model',''),maxOutputTokens:value('tokens',2048),requestsPerMinute:value('rpm',6),canManage:auth.role==='owner'};}
export function configure(auth,input){
 identity(auth);if(auth.role!=='owner')throw error('AI_FORBIDDEN',403);
 if(!input||typeof input!=='object'||Array.isArray(input))throw error('AI_INVALID_SETTINGS');
 const changes=[];let changedKey=false;
 if(input.deleteKey&&input.apiKey)throw error('AI_INVALID_SETTINGS');
 if(input.apiKey){const k=String(input.apiKey).trim();if(k.length<16||k.length>512||!/^[-_A-Za-z0-9]+$/.test(k))throw error('AI_INVALID_KEY');changes.push(['key',seal({key:k},'gemini-key')]);changedKey=true;}
 if(input.model!==undefined){if(typeof input.model!=='string'||(input.model&&!/^models\/[A-Za-z0-9._-]+$/.test(input.model)))throw error('AI_INVALID_MODEL');changes.push(['model',input.model]);}
 for(const [field,k,min,max]of[['maxOutputTokens','tokens',128,32768],['requestsPerMinute','rpm',1,120]])if(input[field]!==undefined){const n=Number(input[field]);if(!Number.isInteger(n)||n<min||n>max)throw error('AI_INVALID_LIMIT');changes.push([k,n]);}
 const d=store();d.exec('BEGIN IMMEDIATE');try{if(input.deleteKey){d.prepare('DELETE FROM settings WHERE k=?').run('key');changedKey=true;}for(const [k,v]of changes)set(k,v);d.exec('COMMIT');}catch(e){d.exec('ROLLBACK');throw e;}
 if(changedKey){modelEpoch++;modelCache=null;modelsPending=null;for(const c of active.values())c.abort();}
